# 统一换行符，避免 Windows 上 clone 后满屏 CRLF 混排
* text=auto eol=lf

# 二进制：不要做任何换行/文本转换
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.mp4 binary
*.m4a binary
*.jar binary
*.apk binary

# 脚本按平台约定
gradlew        text eol=lf
*.sh           text eol=lf
*.bat          text eol=crlf
*.ps1          text eol=crlf
